Response body is built by `/home/daniel/sandbox/src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/rest/function/owner/OwnerResponse.java` (`enriched(...)` = `ownerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)` plus bulkSignupWarning, capacityWarning, riskFlag). Both `RespondWithOwner` (200) and `RespondWithOwnerCreated` (201) return this same body.

